/Type /StructElem
/S /H2
/P 74 0 R
/T (Qu Yongzhong has devoted more than 50 years to calligraphy practice and research. An accomplished art connoisseur, he has published numerous calligraphy works and articles on art. His works have been exhibited in many countries and regions and collected by museums, galleries, arts centres, libraries, government institutions, political figures in China and Canada, and other prominent individuals.)
/E (Qu Yongzhong has devoted more than 50 years to calligraphy practice and research. An accomplished art connoisseur, he has published numerous calligraphy works and articles on art. His works have been exhibited in many countries and regions and collected by museums, galleries, arts centres, libraries, government institutions, political figures in China and Canada, and other prominent individuals.)
/Pg 12 0 R
/K [5]
>>
endobj
120 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H2
/P 74 0 R
/T (His biography and works appear in more than 20 major art reference volumes, including Ink Works by Contemporary Chinese Masters of Calligraphy, Collected Works of Contemporary Chinese Masters of Calligraphy and Painting, A Panorama of Chinese Calligraphy and Seal-Carving Art, Dictionary of Modern Artists of the World, and A Collection of One Hundred Calligraphers and Painters in North America.)
/E (His biography and works appear in more than 20 major art reference volumes, including Ink Works by Contemporary Chinese Masters of Calligraphy, Collected Works of Contemporary Chinese Masters of Calligraphy and Painting, A Panorama of Chinese Calligraphy and Seal-Carving Art, Dictionary of Modern Artists of the World, and A Collection of One Hundred Calligraphers and Painters in North America.)
/Pg 12 0 R
/K [6]
>>
endobj
121 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H2
/P 74 0 R
/T (His works have received more than ten awards in Chinese and international calligraphy and painting competitions. In 1992, his running-script calligraphy won second prize in the adult category of the Hope Cup National Calligraphy and Painting Competition. In 1993, China Central Television and several international arts organizations awarded him the title of Outstanding Artist of the World. In 2002, his zhangcao \(clerical cursive\) calligraphy received the Qunxing Award from China's Ministry of Culture. In 2016, he received an Outstanding Art Award from Canada's federal multiculturalism department.)
/E (His works have received more than ten awards in Chinese and international calligraphy and painting competitions. In 1992, his running-script calligraphy won second prize in the adult category of the Hope Cup National Calligraphy and Painting Competition. In 1993, China Central Television and several international arts organizations awarded him the title of Outstanding Artist of the World. In 2002, his zhangcao \(clerical cursive\) calligraphy received the Qunxing Award from China's Ministry of Culture. In 2016, he received an Outstanding Art Award from Canada's federal multiculturalism department.)
/Pg 12 0 R
/K [7]
>>
endobj
122 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H2
/P 74 0 R
/T (For many years, Qu has actively promoted traditional Chinese culture overseas and supported cultural activities for the public good. Through online and in-person exhibitions, television features, newspaper and online columns devoted to calligraphy and painting, short calligraphy videos, public online platforms, and his own internet accounts, he has shared traditional Chinese calligraphy and painting across North America and around the world, making a positive social contribution.)
/E (For many years, Qu has actively promoted traditional Chinese culture overseas and supported cultural activities for the public good. Through online and in-person exhibitions, television features, newspaper and online columns devoted to calligraphy and painting, short calligraphy videos, public online platforms, and his own internet accounts, he has shared traditional Chinese calligraphy and painting across North America and around the world, making a positive social contribution.)
/Pg 12 0 R
