/Title (His works have received more than ten awards in Chinese and international calligraphy and painting competitions. In 1992, his running-script calligraphy won second prize in the adult category of the Hope Cup National Calligraphy and Painting Competition. In 1993, China Central Television and several international arts organizations awarded him the title of Outstanding Artist of the World. In 2002, his zhangcao \(clerical cursive\) calligraphy received the Qunxing Award from China's Ministry of Culture. In 2016, he received an Outstanding Art Award from Canada's federal multiculturalism department.)
